; Pay-to-pubkey: verify a BIP340 signature over the taproot script-path
; sighash. `pk` and `sig` come from the witness env; the message is the
; current input's BIP342 sighash. (Evaluated in tests/eval.rs with a real
; signature, since it needs a transaction context.)
(bip340_verify pk (bip342_txmsg) sig)
